#: .\templates\components\home\item.html:101
msgid "ASTRO NUMEROLOGY – CUSTOM 12 MONTH FORECAST"
msgstr "ASTRO-NUMEROLOGIA – PREVISIONE PERSONALIZZATA DI 12 MESI"

#: .\templates\components\home\item.html:103
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Anticipate your future. Act at the right time. \n"
"                    Through the astro-numerological analysis of your birth, "
"a complete forecast of the next 12 months is elaborated, to guide you "
"clearly in the most important choices of your life. \n"
"                    It's not just prediction... it is awareness of time.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
